  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;passes through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;is perpendicular to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Let the shortest distance between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;S.D.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9f5a553f-9f3c-4925-8269-6927a3fb2edb-9895820.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 218px;\" /></p><p>S.D.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>108</mn></math></p><p>So, shortest distance (S.D.)&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>108</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
